# Who must approve changes to each part of the skill (docs/change-management.md).
# GitHub requests these reviewers automatically. With branch protection set to "Require review
# from Code Owners", a change can't merge without them.
#
# In a company, each line names the team that owns that decision, for example:
#   /packs/*/pricing.json   @acme/sales-ops @acme/finance
#   /packs/*/terms.md       @acme/legal
# This is a one-person portfolio repo, so every line names its owner.

